        <div className="pressure-intro-copy"><p>Pressotherapy uses soft inflatable garments and controlled air compression to create a gentle, wave-like massage across selected areas of the body.</p><p>Each session is shaped around your comfort, treatment area and suitability. You remain fully clothed beneath the garments and simply relax while the programme runs.</p><div className="pressure-pill-row"><span>Rhythmic compression</span><span>Relaxing</span><span>Personalised</span></div></div>
